---
description: Prepare the useful requested private adoption finding from actual native observations.
args:
  goal: string
  evidence: AdoptionEvidence
returns: AdoptionNoteDraft
---
Compose the actual requested note. Explain the native observations that settle the user's question, distinguishing installed provenance, proposed composition and unavailable information. Select relevant exact native references when they help; the proof list may be empty when the requested explanation needs no copied reference. Each reference you do provide must be an actual observed native value. Do not require an authored path set, a fixed number of facts, a private disposition word or a full report echo. A draft is not a completed artifact or permission to record it.
